                    </div>
                    <p style="color: var(--slate-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">Tambah tanya-jawab umum seputar pemesanan web.</p>
                </button>

                <button type="button" onclick="quickCreateTarget('service')" style="background: var(--navy-surface); border: 1px solid var(--navy-surface-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--royal-blue)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--navy-surface-border)'; this.style.transform='none'">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                        <span style="font-size: 1.3rem;">💼</span>
                        <strong style="color: #fff; font-size: 0.95rem;">Layanan Baru</strong>
                    </div>
                    <p style="color: var(--slate-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">Kelola tier layanan website & paket harga.</p>
                </button>

                <button type="button" onclick="quickCreateTarget('livechat')" style="background: var(--navy-surface); border: 1px solid var(--navy-surface-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--royal-blue)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--navy-surface-border)'; this.style.transform='none'">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                        <span style="font-size: 1.3rem;">💬</span>
                        <strong style="color: #fff; font-size: 0.95rem;">Inbox Live Chat</strong>
                    </div>
                    <p style="color: var(--slate-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">Buka obrolan langsung dan balas percakapan klien.</p>
